  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="7"> Reference: LRFD 3.8.2; 10th Edition (2024) </paragraph> <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="p_V_III = 0.02 ksf" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>p_V_III = 0.02 ksf</expbody><expresult> = 0.020 ksf</expresult></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Prescribed Strength III vertical wind pressure</paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True"><dynexp formula="α_V = 1/4" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False"><expbody>α_V = 1/4</expbody><expresult> = 0.250</expresult></dynexp></paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Windward quarter-point distance from the deck centerline (fraction of the deck width) (LRFD 3.8.2)</paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True"><dynexp formula="e_V = α_V*w_deck to ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False"><expbody>e_V = α_V*w_deck to ft</expbody><expresult> = 3.396 ft</expresult></dynexp></paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Transverse eccentricity of the vertical wind resultant from the deck centerline</paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True"><dynexp formula="w_V_III = p_V_III*w_deck to kip/ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False"><expbody>w_V_III = p_V_III*w_deck to kip/ft</expbody><expresult> = 0.272 kip/ft</expresult></dynexp></paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength III upward wind line load</paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True"><dynexp formula="m_V_III = w_V_III*e_V to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False"><expbody>m_V_III = w_V_III*e_V to kip</expbody><expresult> = 0.923 kip</expresult></dynexp></paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength III overturning moment per unit bridge length from vertical wind</paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True"><dynexp formula="w_T0_III = P_Z_III*d_super to kip/ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False"><expbody>w_T0_III = P_Z_III*d_super to kip/ft</expbody><expresult> = 0.345 kip/ft</expresult></dynexp></paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Concurrent perpendicular concrete wind line load</paragraph><embed spacingbefore="5" spacingafter="8"><table name="C001VerticalResults" capture="False" colwidths="1:135, 2:135, 3:135, 4:135"><stylerule range="A1:D2" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" valueformat="RoundedNumber(3, 3, {PriorityUnits: []})" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.6, &quot;#6A9075&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.4, &quot;#6A9075&quot;);"/><stylerule range="A1:D1" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/><stylerule range="B2:D2" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/><row><textcell name="C001VerticalResultsR0C0" capture="False" background="#DCECE0"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Limit state</paragraph></textcell><textcell name="C001VerticalResultsR0C1" capture="False" background="#DCECE0"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Upward line load</paragraph></textcell><textcell name="C001VerticalResultsR0C2" capture="False" background="#DCECE0"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Eccentricity</paragraph></textcell><textcell name="C001VerticalResultsR0C3" capture="False" background="#DCECE0"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Concrete horizontal</paragraph></textcell></row><row><textcell name="C001VerticalResultsR1C0" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0">Strength III</paragraph></textcell><c formula="w_V_III to kip/ft" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1"><num>0.272 kip/ft</num></c><c formula="e_V to ft" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1"><num>3.396 ft</num></c><c formula="w_T0_III to kip/ft" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1"><num>0.345 kip/ft</num></c></row></table></embed><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="7">The load-generation table precedes combination factors. Apply the matching factors once in C004. Vertical wind is excluded from other limit states and from skew-wind cases.</paragraph> <section name="VerticalReferenceSummary" capture="False" hide="false"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True" id="paragraphc001ref12">9. Vertical wind load reference (LRFD 3.8.2)</paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="7"> Reference: Primary code excerpt: LRFD 3.8.2, 10th Edition (2024) </paragraph> <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="7">C001 generates the vertical line loads and windward eccentricity. C004 combines them with gravity and perpendicular horizontal wind for the bearing-contact and overturning checks.</paragraph> </section><embed spacingbefore="5" spacingafter="8"><table name="C001VerticalReferenceLive" capture="False" colwidths="1:180, 2:180, 3:180"><stylerule range="A1:C2" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" valueformat="RoundedNumber(3, 3, {PriorityUnits: []})" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.6, &quot;#6A9075&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.4, &quot;#6A9075&quot;);"/><stylerule range="A1:C1" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/><stylerule range="B2:C2" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/><row><textcell name="C001VerticalReferenceLiveR0C0" capture="False" background="#DCECE0"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Limit state</paragraph></textcell><textcell name="C001VerticalReferenceLiveR0C1" capture="False" background="#DCECE0"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Upward line load</paragraph></textcell><textcell name="C001VerticalReferenceLiveR0C2" capture="False" background="#DCECE0"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Windward eccentricity</paragraph></textcell></row><row><textcell name="C001VerticalReferenceLiveR1C0" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1"><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0">Strength III</paragraph></textcell><c formula="w_V_III to kip/ft" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1"><num>0.272 kip/ft</num></c><c formula="e_V to ft" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1"><num>3.396 ft</num></c></row></table></embed><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">10. Checks</paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True"><dynexp formula="Status = &quot;✓ All Checks Pass&quot;" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False"><expbody>Status = "✓ All Checks Pass"</expbody><expresult> = ✓ All Checks Pass</expresult></dynexp></paragraph><paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Overall status of the recomputed numerical checks.</paragraph></report>